      "width": 896.517877408311,
      "height": 114.68175850321867,
      "text": "amount and service_description are a snapshot taken when the order is created\nfolio comes from order_folio_seq. \nPostgreSQL sequence that starts at 1000\ncancelled_at NULL means the order is still active",
      "fontSize": 22.936351700643733,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "textAlign": "left",
